  "prompt": {
    "user_question": "Evaluate acute auxin-induced SCAF1-AID degradation effects on chromatin occupancy in human U2OS cells comparing Auxin versus Control across 3 biological CUT&RUN replicates per group plus an Untagged negative control, using heterologous E. coli K-12 MG1655 spike-in normalization on GRCh38 (GEO GSE273126). Run paired-end FASTQ QC, bwa-mem2 human + E. coli spike-in alignment, nucleosomal fragment and IgG calibration QC, SEACR peak calling, spike-in scaled differential binding (Auxin versus Control), motif enrichment, and cis gene annotation.",
